<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-29T10:43:03+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sat, 29 Aug 2026 10:43:03 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[US to establish first space academy, expand "far beyond the Moon"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133603759.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Trump has taken a monumental step by signing an order to create America's inaugural space academy, designed to elevate the nation's future leaders in space exploration. In a momentous interaction, he engaged with astronauts on the International Space Station. This initiative follows prior plans for lunar missions and commercial ventures, culminating in the recognition of the Artemis II crew with the prestigious Congressional Space Medal of Honour.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-to-establish-first-space-academy-expand-far-beyond-the-moon/articleshow/133603759.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-to-establish-first-space-academy-expand-far-beyond-the-moon/articleshow/133603759.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-29T09:55:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133603805,imgsize-83870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maya Higa Reveals Engagement: Streamer shares ‘best surprise of my life’; fans quiz Caleb vs FaZe Adapt]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133601663.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Maya Higa has announced her engagement to her longtime partner Caleb, sharing proposal photos and calling it the “best surprise” of her life. Unlike the popular streamer, Caleb maintains a largely private life and does not appear to be a prominent content creator. Higa previously revealed they met through mutual friends at a bar and had been together for about a year by 2023. Fans briefly mistook Caleb for streamer FaZe Adapt.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-maya-higas-fianc-what-we-know-about-caleb-after-streamer-announces-engagement/articleshow/133601663.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-maya-higas-fianc-what-we-know-about-caleb-after-streamer-announces-engagement/articleshow/133601663.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-29T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133601668,imgsize-154582.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['I still struggle': Landlady recalls Saudi man who brought 9/11 hijackers to her office]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-